    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20.7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 20.7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa hine wrecan wille oððe [heora ænigne] fǽlæce, þonne beo he fah wið ðone cyng ⁊ wið ealle his freond.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone tries to avenge him, or institutes a vendetta against any of them [who slew him] then he shall incur the hostility of the king and all his friends.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hine ðonne hwa awrecan wille oþþe heora ænigne falæce, ðonne sy he fah wiþ ðone cyng ⁊ wiþ ealle his freond.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
